      "sourceId": "0070:000018",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「ああ、そうだ」",
      "english": "“That's right.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000019",
      "line": 19,
      "sourceId": "0070:000019",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　千鳥の目の前に、二冊のバインダーが置いてある。",
      "english": "Two binders lay before Chidori.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000020",
      "line": 20,
      "sourceId": "0070:000020",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「どこが調べたんです？」",
      "english": "“Who conducted the investigation?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000022",
      "line": 22,
      "sourceId": "0070:000022",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「西新井スタッフセンター」",
      "english": "“The Nishiarai Staff Center.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000024",
      "line": 24,
      "sourceId": "0070:000024",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「清田さんのチームですか」",
      "english": "“Kiyota's team?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000025",
      "line": 25,
      "sourceId": "0070:000025",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「……ああ」",
      "english": "“...Yes.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000027",
      "line": 27,
      "sourceId": "0070:000027",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　千鳥はスチール机の上から、一冊のバインダーを\n取り上げた。",
      "english": "Chidori lifted one of the binders off the steel desk.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000028",
      "line": 28,
      "sourceId": "0070:000028",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　すでに綿密な調査が行われたのだろう、かなり分\n厚い。",
      "english": "Judging by its thickness, the investigation must have been exhaustive.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000030",
      "line": 30,
      "sourceId": "0070:000030",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　開いて目を走らせる。\n　それぞれの書類には顔写真と個人データ、学歴・\n職歴等が記されている。",
      "english": "She opened it and ran her eyes over the pages. Each file included a photograph and personal details, along with the subject's educational and employment history.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000032",
      "line": 32,
      "sourceId": "0070:000032",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　ほとんど履歴書に近い。\n　唯一違う点があるとすれば、それは書類の最後に\nある数値データであろう。",
      "english": "They read almost like résumés. If anything set them apart, it was the numerical data at the end of each file.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000035",
      "line": 35,
      "sourceId": "0070:000035",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「……低いですね、どれも」",
      "english": "“...They're all low.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000037",
      "line": 37,
      "sourceId": "0070:000037",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「当然だ」",
      "english": "“Naturally.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000044",
      "line": 44,
      "sourceId": "0070:000044",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　安永茂（２８）男／公務員\n　\n　感応\n　　　上流１．５\n　　　下流０．２\n　操作０\n　作用１",
      "english": "Shigeru Yasunaga (28), male / civil servant  Sensitivity     Upstream 1.5     Downstream 0.2 Control 0 Effect 1",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000046",
      "line": 46,
      "sourceId": "0070:000046",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　林文夫（４２）男／自営業\n　\n　感応\n　　　上流１．９\n　　　下流１．１\n　操作０．１\n　作用１．２",
      "english": "Fumio Hayashi (42), male / self-employed  Sensitivity     Upstream 1.9     Downstream 1.1 Control 0.1 Effect 1.2",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000055",
      "line": 55,
      "sourceId": "0070:000055",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　千鳥はすぐに傾向を読み取った。",
      "english": "Chidori identified the pattern at once.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000056",
      "line": 56,
      "sourceId": "0070:000056",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「確かに期待はしていませんでしたけれど、予測と\n　完全に一致していますね」",
      "english": "“I admit I wasn't expecting much, but the results match our projections exactly.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000058",
      "line": 58,
      "sourceId": "0070:000058",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「そのようだ」",
      "english": "“So it seems.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000060",
      "line": 60,
      "sourceId": "0070:000060",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　全体的に低い。\n　０．１～２。このあたりが最高だ。",
      "english": "The scores were low across the board. Between 0.1 and 2. That was as high as they went.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000061",
      "line": 61,
      "sourceId": "0070:000061",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　感応はもっとも顕著に数値が出ているが、上流に\n比べて下流は一律に低い。",
      "english": "Sensitivity produced the clearest readings, but downstream scores were uniformly lower than upstream ones.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000062",
      "line": 62,
      "sourceId": "0070:000062",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　数値自体も人によって高低の差がまちまちではあ\nるが、目立つデータはない。",
      "english": "The figures varied from subject to subject, but none of them stood out.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000063",
      "line": 63,
      "sourceId": "0070:000063",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　能力においてもっとも重要な操作においては、絶\n望的な低さに思えた。",
      "english": "Control, the most important measure of ability, seemed dismally low.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000066",
      "line": 66,
      "sourceId": "0070:000066",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「覚醒プログラムをフルで適用しても、数値的には\n　せいぜい２から５」",
      "english": "“Even with the full awakening program, we'd be looking at figures of two to five at best.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000068",
      "line": 68,
      "sourceId": "0070:000068",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「薬物を用いれば、だが」",
      "english": "“With drugs, that is.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000070",
      "line": 70,
      "sourceId": "0070:000070",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「そうですね……」",
      "english": "“Yes...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000071",
      "line": 71,
      "sourceId": "0070:000071",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　鼻の下に曲げた指を添える。\n　困った時の、千鳥の癖だ。",
      "english": "She crooked a finger beneath her nose, a habit of hers when troubled.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000073",
      "line": 73,
      "sourceId": "0070:000073",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「感応値の高さにしても、単にこちら側の測定手法\n　が確立されているという側面もありますものね」",
      "english": "“Even the higher sensitivity figures may simply reflect that our methods for measuring it are better established.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000074",
      "line": 74,
      "sourceId": "0070:000074",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「生活環境との因果関係も、\n　あるようには見えない……」",
      "english": "“Nor does there seem to be any causal link to their living conditions...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000076",
      "line": 76,
      "sourceId": "0070:000076",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「今期の調査では、ほぼすべての観測対象がＥ級分\n　類だということだ」",
      "english": "“Which means nearly every subject in this round of testing falls into Class E.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000078",
      "line": 78,
      "sourceId": "0070:000078",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「でしょうね、この調子では」",
      "english": "“I would expect so, at this rate.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000079",
      "line": 79,
      "sourceId": "0070:000079",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　判っていたことだった。\n　人類はそうたいしたものではない。",
      "english": "They had known as much. Humanity was not so exceptional.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000080",
      "line": 80,
      "sourceId": "0070:000080",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　生物学的に、これ以上新しい変化を迎え入れる存\n在ではない。",
      "english": "Biologically, humanity was no longer a species open to further change.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000081",
      "line": 81,
      "sourceId": "0070:000081",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　人為的な変化が必要なのだった。\n　それも全てでなくて良い。\n　次世代に繋がる、一部であれば―――",
      "english": "The change would have to be artificial. It need not encompass all of humanity. A fraction would suffice—enough to carry the next generation forward.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000083",
      "line": 83,
      "sourceId": "0070:000083",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「……ん」",
      "english": "“...Mm.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000084",
      "line": 84,
      "sourceId": "0070:000084",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　資料を繰っていた千鳥の手が、止まる。",
      "english": "Chidori's hand stilled on the page.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000091",
      "line": 91,
      "sourceId": "0070:000091",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　本堂鏡子（３１）女／無職\n　\n　感応\n　　　上流０．１\n　　　下流０．１\n　操作０．５\n　作用３４",
      "english": "Kyouko Hondou (31), female / unemployed  Sensitivity     Upstream 0.1     Downstream 0.1 Control 0.5 Effect 34",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000100",
      "line": 100,
      "sourceId": "0070:000100",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「……灰野さん」",
      "english": "“...Haino.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
