      "line": 103,
      "sourceId": "0070:000103",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　煙草をもみ消す。",
      "english": "He stubbed out his cigarette.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000105",
      "line": 105,
      "sourceId": "0070:000105",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「３０どころか、５を超えている者はそいつだけだ」",
      "english": "“Never mind thirty. She is the only one above five.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000106",
      "line": 106,
      "sourceId": "0070:000106",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「分類はＡ級ですか」",
      "english": "“Class A?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000108",
      "line": 108,
      "sourceId": "0070:000108",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「重要監視対象だな」",
      "english": "“Then she's a high-priority surveillance target.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000110",
      "line": 110,
      "sourceId": "0070:000110",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「だが少々厄介だ」",
      "english": "“But she presents something of a problem.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000112",
      "line": 112,
      "sourceId": "0070:000112",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「本堂という名前、聞いたことがありますね」",
      "english": "“Hondou... I've heard that name before.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000113",
      "line": 113,
      "sourceId": "0070:000113",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「例の一族だ」",
      "english": "“That family.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000115",
      "line": 115,
      "sourceId": "0070:000115",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「……例の」",
      "english": "“...That family.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000116",
      "line": 116,
      "sourceId": "0070:000116",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　眉がかすかにひそまる。\n　政治に深々と食い込み、長年に渡り独自の立場を\n得ている古い一族のことは、千鳥も知っていた。",
      "english": "Her brow tightened almost imperceptibly. Chidori knew of the old family that had embedded itself deep in politics and maintained an independent position for generations.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000118",
      "line": 118,
      "sourceId": "0070:000118",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「本堂が古くから呪術的な役割で為政者と繋がって\n　いたことを考えると、当然の結果なのかもしれん」",
      "english": "“Given the Hondou family's ancient ties to rulers as practitioners of ritual magic, perhaps the result is only natural.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000120",
      "line": 120,
      "sourceId": "0070:000120",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「秘密主義的な連中だが、今の本堂はまだましだ」",
      "english": "“They’re a secretive lot, though the Hondou family of today isn’t as bad.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000122",
      "line": 122,
      "sourceId": "0070:000122",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「……時代が時代ですから」",
      "english": "“...Times being what they are.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000124",
      "line": 124,
      "sourceId": "0070:000124",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「そうだな」",
      "english": "“Quite.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000125",
      "line": 125,
      "sourceId": "0070:000125",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　平坦に灰野は言った。",
      "english": "Haino's reply was flat.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000127",
      "line": 127,
      "sourceId": "0070:000127",
      "speakerJa": "灰野",
      "speakerEn": "Haino",
      "japanese": "「都合は良い。だが時間がない」",
      "english": "“Convenient for us. But we have no time.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000128",
      "line": 128,
      "sourceId": "0070:000128",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　危機的な状況だった。\n　が、灰野の声に切迫した様子はない。",
      "english": "The situation was critical. Nothing in Haino's voice suggested urgency.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0070:000129",
      "line": 129,
      "sourceId": "0070:000129",
